trument calibration certificates; qualified personnel; manufacturer certificate/factory test report or equivalent; POI recloser factory acceptance records (DPS-07 §6.1); and AHJ re-inspection or written confirmation that permit BE-2025-0148 covers the installed Selvix SV-720 (the substitution post-dates the 06/09/2025 sign-off). No PTO until the signed witness record, the ER-11/recloser determination, the AHJ reconciliation and TCS-02 §5 live telemetry are on file.\n\nSee Municipal_Witness_Test_Package.docx Rev 1 (DER Program Office, 07/14/2025).	2025-07-29	\N	1	11	9	\N	4	\N	\N	2025-07-15	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	11	f	\N	\N
