47	1	3	Schedule witness test — Holcott Public Library (Selvix SV-720)	Witness test required under ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §4.1 because the inverter installed at Holcott Public Library (Selvix SV-720) is not carried on CEL-2025-Q2; it appears only on the superseded CEL-2024-Q4 (Inverters row 29, 720 kW, UL 1741-SB, effective 10/31/2024). The checklist pre-mark relying on CEL-2024-Q4 is not a valid waiver basis.\n\nScope: IEEE 1547.1 testing per ENG-PRC-014 §4.2, at minimum protective-function trip tests, anti-islanding test (the method actually installed; if passive-only, the DPS-07 §4.5 study must be on file), and Category II voltage/frequency ride-through verifications. Full DPS-07 Rev 2 §6.2 site-acceptance set: item 1 insulation-resistance/dielectric, item 2 CT/VT ratio-polarity-burden, item 3 functional test of each enabled ANSI function, item 4 end-to-end trip through the interrupting device, item 5 local/remote control-status-metering, item 6 synchronism check and reclose-block logic, item 7 visible-break/lockout. No POI recloser is identified at Holcott, so the Form ER-11 determination on the DPS-07 §4.2 question governs whether one is required and which §6.2 items attach to it. Customer/commissioning agent performs with calibrated instrumentation and qualified personnel; the Alleniom Standards Engineering witness engineer observes, records and signs the test record; Distribution Protection Engineering issues the §6.3 written acceptance.\n\nProposed test date: 07/22/2025. Reserve date: 07/25/2025. Prerequisites due 07/15/2025: completed checklist with actual model/serial/firmware and current-CEL non-listing reference; as-built single-line and equipment schedule; approved protection settings sheet and coordination study; anti-islanding method statement / DPS-07 §4.5 study; IEEE 1547.1 test plan; instrument calibration certificates; qualified personnel; manufacturer certificate/factory test report or equivalent. No PTO until the signed witness record, the ER-11 determination and TCS-02 §5 live telemetry are on file.\n\nSee Municipal_Witness_Test_Package.docx Rev 1 (DER Program Office, 07/14/2025).	2025-07-22	\N	1	11	9	\N	4	1	\N	\N	2026-11-20 12:00:28.104461+00	2026-11-20 13:39:31.040266+00	2025-07-15	\N	\N	1	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	6	f	\N	\N	\N
